      <description>Landscaping that turns a plot into a finished garden

We landscape private gardens, hotel grounds and shared spaces. We prepare the site, create flower beds and mixed borders, plant trees and shrubs, build hedges and combine planting with lawns and automatic irrigation.

Benefits

Complete delivery: We coordinate site preparation, planting, turf and irrigation.

Plant selection for the site: We choose plants to suit light, soil and climate.

A finished look: We create compositions, flower beds, hedges and green areas.

Aftercare: We can provide recommendations and ongoing maintenance.

How we work

1. Site survey and plan: We assess the terrain, existing plants and project needs.

2. Preparation: We clear and shape the site and improve the soil according to the plan.

3. Planting and shaping: We position and plant greenery and finish the compositions.

4. Watering and handover: We water the plants, check the work and explain care.

Contact Florial

Request a site visit for landscaping your property.</description>
